    <worksheet name='Spread by Condition'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Hip/knee results vary most between hospitals; COPD least</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Share of hospitals more than 10% better (blue) or worse (orange) than expected</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Share of hospitals with an excess readmission ratio more than 10% better (below 0.90) or worse (above 1.10) than expected. Every condition has about 48% of hospitals above 1.0. The spread is what differs: hip/knee results vary most, COPD least.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location id='SpreadbyCondition' path='/workbooks/HospitalReadmissions_17924318810080' revision='' />
      <table>
