        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Share of hospital results with an excess readmission ratio above 1.0 (more readmissions than expected). States with fewer than 10 hospitals reporting a ratio are left blank (DC, DE, VT, ND, AK, WY, RI under All conditions; more states are blank for single conditions).</run>
