              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Type or pick a hospital in the list below to see, for each condition, whether it had more or fewer readmissions than CMS expected for its patients.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#898989'>Source: CMS Hospital Readmissions Reduction Program, discharges July 2021 to June 2024. Medicare patients only.</run>
